ill find you, I promise!\n\n*Melina calling Isabella*\nIsa: Hello!\nMelina: Hi, I have to ask for something.\nIsa: Yeah?\nMelina: Can you help me find my parents?\nIsa: They've gone missing for over 5 years!\nMelina: Yeah, but please. I think they are out there somewhere.\nIsa: What if they are dead!\nMelina: ...\nIsa: You can't know.\nMelina: I'll ask Ella instead...\nIsa: No no no no, I'm helping you.\nMelina: Thanks! Now I'll call Ella!\nIsa: Noooo *beep*\n\n*Melina calling Ella*\nElla: Hi? What's happening?\nMelina: DO-YOU-WANNA-HELP-ME-FIND-MY-PARENTS(very fast)\nElla: Excuse me? \nMelina: Do you wanna, wanna, wanna find my paaarentss.\nElla: Ok?\nMelina: THANK-YOU-SO-MUCH\nElla: Can my boyfriend Albert come too?\nMelina: ...\nElla: Pleeeaaaaseeee\nMelina: Ok... *Beep*\n\nLater everyone meets up but Isa isn't there yet\n*A boy walks up to them*\nAlex: What's up?\nElla: Who are you?\nAlex: Alexander, but call me Alex.\nMelina: We are doing something here.\n*Lisa comes*\nLisa: What are you guys doing? And why do you have my old suitcase with you, Melina?\n*Isa and Lisbeth/Lissie coming*\nIsa: Are we late?\nMelina: Why is Lissie here?\nIsa: She wanted to come with us. And who is that?\nMelin: *Sigh*\nAlex: I'm Alexander. Who are you guys.\nIsa: Isabella, and this is my sister Lisbeth.\nLissie: Hello!\nAlbert: I'm Albert and this is my girlfriend...\nElla: Ella\nLisa: I'm Lissanna, but what are you doing???\nAlbert: We are going to find Melina's parents.\nLisa: THEY ARE MY PARENTS TOO!\nMelina: Idiot (whispering)\nLisa: Melina, please explain this for me!\nMelina: I just want to find our parents...\nLisa: I'm going too!\nMelina: REALLY???\nLisa: Yeah let's go!\nIsa: Exactly where are we going?\nLisa: Into our house. If there's any clues they have to be there."},"#m7/ZGEQm]7XhRFlufu7":{"blockId":null,"x":567,"y":2011,"width":200,"height":200,"minimized":false,"text":"Sorry if that was confusing "}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"klädsel1","bitmapResolution"